<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-E.PROVINCE 81-0 AT LUNCH VS NORTHERNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-E.PROVINCE 81-0 AT LUNCH VS NORTHERNS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province, having won the toss and elected to bat, were 81 without loss at lunch on the opening day of their Supersport series cricket match against Northern Transvaal on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Eastern Province: 81-0 (Michael Beamish 35, Carl Bradfield 31).</p>
